            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Necrotic Runoff"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, poison)\n\n60 feet. A seetangeist secretes foul fluids into the surrounding water, poisoning it. A creature that enters or starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 29 Fortitude save or become sickened 2 (sickened 3 on a critical failure). Creatures that breathe water take a \u20132 circumstance penalty to this saving throw. As long as a creature remains in the aura, it can't reduce its sickened condition below 1. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute."
            },
